      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Heart of Fear: The Rebirth [zone=925]\n**Who:**\n- Provisoner Lena [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a nefarious believer [npc=43619]\n- a tentacle terror [npc=43635]\n- a wicked believer [npc=43638]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 16 06:37:28 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor\n\n---\n\nThis is a kill task that begins with Provisioner Lena in the Heart of Fear: The Rebirth at location 50, 10, -400 (on the platform in the center of the zone).\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Provisioner Lena'\nProvisioner Lena looks you up and down with judging eyes, 'Well you certainly look well-fed. The Harbingers can't claim the same. It's impossible to get a good meal in this layer of the crystal. It's too much trouble to bring in supplies, so I cook with whatever I can get my hands on. I'm preparing a large batch of tentacle stew, which is surprisingly tasty. I still need a few [ingredients] before it can begin simmering.\nYou say, 'I can get you the ingredients'\nProvisioner Lena thanks you with a modest smile as she jots down the needed ingredients.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Tentacle Stew'.\n\n---\n\nSlay tentacles and collect bits of their meat 0/5 (Heart of Fear: The Rebirth)\nThere is a room with 6 tentacle terrors in the northeast section at loc +725, -588, -463.\nSlay Believers and extract their bone marrow 0/5 (Heart of Fear: The Rebirth)\nReturn to Provisioner Lena 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Rebirth)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
