      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Heart of Fear: The Epicenter [zone=926]\n**Who:**\n- Naju Uddo [npc=43520]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 16 06:38:12 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with a gnome named Naju Uddo in the Heart of Fear (The Epicenter) at location -705, -245, -513 (at the southeastern entrance; findable with CTRL+F)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Naju Uddo'\nNaju Uddo peers at you with questionable curiosity, 'Have you ever seen a creature as interesting as an amygdalan? The way tentacles cascade down their face to form a barnacle encrusted beard is remarkable, though I find all the creatures of fear and nightmares fascinating. It isn't enough to observe them in the wild, however. I need to [collect] the corpses of creatures, stuff them full of fluff, and set them on my shelf to gaze upon whenever I desire.\nYou say, 'Collect corpses?'\nNaju Uddo says 'So far I've only been able to collect what you see here, but with your help, I can create enough plushy terrors to fill my home in Sunrise Hills!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Terrifying Taxidermy'.\n\n---\n\nCarefully slay a phoboplasm 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\nCarefully slay an amygdalan 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\nCarefully slay a toad 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\nCarefully slay a samhain 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\nCarefully slay a mephit 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\nCarefully slay a banshee 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\n_Note: All of the above mobs are spawned by killing the gestation crystals that are scattered all over the zone._\nReturn to Naju Uddo 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Epicenter)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
