      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Heart of Fear: The Threshold [zone=924]\n**Who:**\n- Harbinger Iska [npc=43507]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Harbinger Risok [npc=43595]\n- a Harbinger scout [npc=43553]\n- a dark believer [npc=43545]\n- a dying scout [npc=43548]\n- a sordid believer [npc=43570]\n**Related Quests:**\n- An End to Fear [quest=6930]\n- Heart of Fear #2: Channeling Cazic [quest=6926]\n- Heart of Fear #3: Growing Fear [quest=6927]\n- Heart of Fear #4: The Heart of Fear [quest=6928]\n- Menace, Doom, and Horror [quest=6929]\n- Raid Expedition: An End to Fear [quest=6936]\n- Raid Expedition: Glimpse, the Unseen [quest=6934]\n- Raid Expedition: Memories of the Faceless [quest=6935]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 16 05:55:43 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the first in a series of four. It begins with Harbinger Iska ( **click for map image**) in the Heart of Fear: The Threshold (first level) at location -85, -10, 75 (at the zone-in: the center of the zone)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Harbinger Iska'\nHarbinger Iska says 'Finally! Someone competent stumbles through here. You may not believe in our mission, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, but you were a significant help up in Shard's Landing. I trust you're still willing to [fight] for us?'\nYou say, 'I'm always willing to fight'\nHarbinger Iska says 'I'm glad to hear it. Things haven't been going as smoothly as we'd hoped down here. Some of my most-trusted Harbingers have gone missing. Will you help me [find] them?'\nYou say, 'I will find them'\nHarbinger Iska says 'Search the caves to the north for them. That's where they were exploring last. Thank you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Harbingers'.\n\n---\n\nSearch for the missing Harbingers 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_This updates in the north-central part of the zone at about 2200, 1600, 3 ( **click for map image**)._\nSpeak to Risok, the party leader 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\nYou say, 'Hail, Harbinger Risok'\nHarbinger Risok says, 'Are you real, or another apparition? Please, help us! Before they come ba--' The party leader is cut short by creatures materializing around the group and rushing in to attack!\nHarbinger Risok calls out as the fear creatures rush toward his scouts, 'If you're really an ally of the Harbingers, help us kill these things!''\n_Four mobs (regular trash mobs for the zone) spawn and make their way to the NPCs._\nDefend the party against apparitions 0/4 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_Note: While these mobs are not auto-aggro, they tend to be a mix of live and undead, so either invis and IVU quickly after the hail, or back away, or be ready to engage them all at once._\n_These mobs will despawn if left idle for longer than two minutes. If this happens, you can re-hail to respawn them._\nSpeak to Risok once again 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\nYou say, 'Hail, Harbinger Risok'\nHarbinger Risok nods his head in thanks to you, 'We're not the only Harbingers out here. Another group headed into the twisting mountain paths over there.' He points to the southwest.\n\n---\n\nSearch for the second party of Harbingers 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_This updates at -2185, 1650, 5 ( **click for map image** \\-\\- southwestern part of the zone, towards the southern boundary)._\nSpeak to one of the scouts 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\nYou say, 'Hail, a Harbinger scout'\na Harbinger scout says 'I can't risk moving the entire group at once, but if you show one of my scouts the way back to the main group, they can return and lead us all there one at a time.'\n_This spawns another scout, which you should lead back to Harbinger Risok. This scout will act like a mercenary in that if you get too far away from it, it warps to your location._\n_If you happen to die or zone and lose the scout, you can re-hail to spawn another._\nLead the Harbinger scout back to Risok 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\na Harbinger scout says 'Harbinger, we were ambushed while trying to collect fear shards. We hid for some time, waiting to be rescued. But Harbinger Clykk and a few others got impatient and left us to fight their way back to camp. It looks like they didn't make it. I'll return to the other survivors and carefully lead them back to this camp.'\nSpeak to Harbinger Risok 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\nYou say, 'Hail, Harbinger Risok'\nHarbinger Risok says 'Thank you for finding them, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. We secured this area while you were away, but if Harbinger Clykk didn't make it back here, I'm afraid I must send you out to find him. Kill any of those pathetic alaran you run into along the way.'\n\n---\n\nRecover the stolen shards 0/6 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_Kill believers (any \"believer\") until you have six updates (there is no actual item here)._\nFind a survivor from the slaughtered party 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_Find a dying scout at location -1060, -2800, 15 ( **click for map image** \\-\\- very far southeastern corner of the zone -- the easternmost \"room\"), and hail it._\nYou say, 'Hail, a dying scout'\na dying scout spits out blood as he gasps for air between words, 'Harbinger Clykk is dead ... They came from the shadows ... to the west. Kill them ... before they kill ... everyone.' His body shudders as he struggles to take his last breath.\n\n---\n\nFind the source of the apparitions 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_This updates at around -2100, -880, 3 ( **click for map image** \\-\\- this is a passage in the far southern part of the zone)._\nAs you approach a cluster of gestation crystals, the shards in your pack start vibrating violently. A loud musical note rings in the cavern as the fear apparitions trapped inside the crystals break free.\nKill the fear apparitions 0/3 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_These spawn from the nearby crystal and are a mix of three regular trash mobs._\n\n---\n\nTell Harbinger Iska what has transpired 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\nYou say, 'Hail, Harbinger Iska'\nHarbinger Iska smiles slightly as she thinks, responding slowly, 'The Believers have moved lower into the crystal. This is good. Cazic-Thule's power will be stronger there. And look what it's already doing here! Those gestation crystals must be a manifestation of his power, working to come back to life.' Harbinger Iska laughs and raises her arms into the air, 'Oh, Cazic-Thule, you will be reborn soon!'\nYou helped Harbinger Iska locate the missing scouts.\n_Rewards:_\n187 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (2% in Level 100 OR 3 AAs)",
