      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Heart of Fear: The Threshold [zone=924]\n**Who:**\n- a Fear beorthor [npc=43510]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Fear of Halflings [npc=43878]\n- Fear of Othmirs [npc=43874]\n- Fear of Ravens [npc=43875]\n- Fear of Shissars [npc=43876]\n- Fear of Wurms [npc=43879]\n- Fear of the Evil Eye [npc=43877]\n- Unknown [npc=43880]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jul 16 06:30:35 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with any one of the \"a fear beorthor\" ( **click for map image**) mobs found in the Heart of Fear: The Threshold (first level)._\n_Map locations of these NPCs (for your \"heartoffear.txt\" map file):_\nP -537.8011, 2550.8025, -36.4176, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_fear\\_beorthor\nP -2146.8486, 983.0232, 32.5888, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_fear\\_beorthor\nP -552.8302, -1316.7843, -0.3268, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_fear\\_beorthor\nP 1325.7717, 497.5431, 1.3307, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_fear\\_beorthor\nP 771.0031, 1955.5959, 1.7991, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_fear\\_beorthor\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No other tasks\n_To start the task, you can either hail the fear beorthor, or attack it. Doing so will cause you to become temporarily blinded and will spawn a mob called \"Unknown\" which auto-aggros on you._\nYou say, 'Hail, a Fear beorthor'\na Fear beorthor's voice enters directly into your mind, 'What is it you fear most? Although many think they know their own fears, there's always something they have yet to discover. A terror so dreaded, you dare not even realize it. Everyone keeps this buried inside, to prevent the fear from consuming them. Now I give that fear flesh, that it may devour you and grow strong!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Facing Your Fear'.\nSlay creatures in the heart of fear to gain insight to gain insight into the nature of your unknown fear. Then confront your fear with its true identity!\n\n---\n\nConfront your unknown fear with its true identity 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_Kill mobs until you can figure out (through emotes) what your fear is. You'll need to /say your answer to the mob \"Unknown\". It will be a fly, evil eye, othmir, wurm, raven, halfling, or shissar._\nFace your fear! 0/1 (Heart of Fear: The Threshold)\n_Kill the mob associated with your fear._\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience\n- Fragment of Legendary Alaran History [item=100964]",
